    "roasted-tomato-white-bean-stew": {
      "id": "roasted-tomato-white-bean-stew",
      "title": "<a href=\"https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/1020926-roasted-tomato-and-white-bean-stew\">Roasted Tomato and White Bean Stew</a> + sourdough + salad greens",
      "do": "Oven 425°; toss tomatoes with ¼ cup olive oil, thyme, salt + pepper; roast 20–25 min until collapsed. Mix chopped parsley + lemon zest. Cook sliced onion + garlic in 2 Tbsp olive oil 4–5 min (skip red-pepper flakes); add beans + 1½ cups broth; simmer; smash ½ cup beans. Stir in roasted tomatoes + juices; simmer 5–10 min; top with parsley-lemon + olive oil. Toast sourdough; toss salad greens with olive oil + lemon juice.",
