      "do": "Heat grill to high. Whisk 3 Tbsp soy sauce + 3 Tbsp balsamic + 1 Tbsp olive oil; toss with broccoli florets; salt lightly. Salt + pepper steaks; grill 4–6 min per side to 130°F; rest 5 min; slice. Grill broccoli in a basket, tossing, 10–12 min until crisp at the edges; drizzle olive oil; top with parsley. Warm bread.",
